List.ofFn.{u_1} f) a) (∃ i, Eq.{u_1 + 1} (f i) a)","unsafe":false,"value":437,"source":{"code":"@[simp 500, grind =]\ntheorem mem_ofFn {n} {f : Fin n → α} {a : α} : a ∈ ofFn f ↔ ∃ i, f i = a := by\n  constructor\n  · intro w\n    obtain ⟨i, h, rfl⟩ := getElem_of_mem w\n    exact ⟨⟨i, by simpa using h⟩, by simp⟩\n  · rintro ⟨i, rfl⟩\n    apply mem_of_getElem (i := i) <;> simp","start":103,"end":110},"axioms":["propext"]}